## 6. Full “contour-on-the-fly” workflow  

```
+-------------------+   fetch tile   +-------------------+   decode   +-------------------+
| MapLibre view     | --------------> | DEM tile (PNG/  | ---------> | Elevation grid    |
| (move/zoom)       |                | GeoTIFF)         |            | (Float32Array)    |
+-------------------+                +-------------------+            +-------------------+
        |                                   |                               |
        |                                   |                               |
        |                                   v                               v
        |                         +-------------------+            +-------------------+
        |                         | Web Worker        |            | d3-contour        |
        |                         | (grid → contours) | ----------> | (thresholds)      |
        |                         +-------------------+            +-------------------+
        |                                   |                               |
        |                                   v                               v
        |                         +-------------------+            +-------------------+
        |                         | Re-project to    |            | GeoJSON Feature   |
        |                         | EPSG:4326 (lng/lat) | ------> | Collection        |
        |                         +-------------------+            +-------------------+
        |                                   |
        |                                   v
        |                         +-------------------+
        |                         | postMessage back  |
        |                         +-------------------+
        |                                   |
        |                                   v
        |                         +-------------------+
        |                         | Add/Update source |
        |                         | + line layer      |
        |                         +-------------------+
        +---------------------------------------------------------------+
```

